 "origem": "autoral. Fatos: NWS 'Turn Around Don't Drown': 12 polegadas de água corrente levam a maioria dos carros, 2 pés levam SUVs e picapes; mais da metade das mortes em enchente é em veículo https://www.weather.gov/safety/flood-turn-around-dont-drown",
 "titulo": "Why one foot of water can float your car 🚗 #engineering #shorts",
 "capa": "1 FOOT OF WATER",
 "descripcion": "A car weighs more than a ton, so why can a foot of moving water carry it away? Buoyancy, lost grip and a road you can't see.\n\nSource: US National Weather Service, Turn Around Don't Drown.\n\nWhat should we explain next?\n\n#engineering #flood #safety #physics #shorts",
